 Warrior Boots (720 gold) as item 1 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Dominance Ice\",\"text\":\"Purchase Dominance Ice (2,010 gold) as item 2 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Blade Armor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Blade Armor (1,910 gold) as item 3 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Antique Cuirass\",\"text\":\"Purchase Antique Cuirass (2,170 gold) as item 4 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Radiant Armor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Radiant Armor (1,880 gold) as item 5 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the Roam Physical DPS Wall build for Baxia.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia#build-roam-physical-dps-wall\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/baxia\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-18T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":87,\"name\":\"Baxia\",\"slug\":\"baxia\",\"title\":\"Mystic Tortoise\",\"role\":[\"Tank\"],\"specialty\":[\"Support\",\"Damage\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"D\",\"difficulty\":1,\"releaseYear\":2019,\"stats\":{\"durability\":100,\"offense\":30,\"controlEffect\":60,\"difficulty\":30},\"winRate\":47.01,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.1,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"change\",\"heroName\":\"Chang'e\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Baxia counters heroes with multi-hit skills or those who rely on shields or HP Regen, such as Chang'e and Silvanna, thanks to his Passive.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"silvanna\",\"heroName\":\"Silvanna\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Baxia counters heroes with multi-hit skills or those who rely on shields or HP Regen, such as Chang'e and Silvanna, thanks to his Passive.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"karrie\",\"heroName\":\"Karrie\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Baxia is countered by agile Marksmen who deal True Damage like Karrie and Lesley because they can easily stay out of Baxia's range while dealing massive damage to him.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"lesley\",\"heroName\":\"Lesley\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Baxia is countered by agile Marksmen who deal True Damage like Karrie and Lesley because they can easily stay out of Baxia's range while dealing massive damage to him.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_478a4875002331e56e73835a2697ad5d.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_80e408203869ca99302af195ac4f756c.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"61\",\"heroName\":\"Chang'e\",\"heroSlug\":\"change\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_1a6b949d43ed33a7ad939ee4a0420b3e.png\",\"tip\":\"Chang'e; Masha; Natalia\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"65\",\"heroName\":\"Claude\",\"heroSlug\":\"claude\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_99318a0a409d80f0f2d4b47ee63b6bda.png\",\"tip\":\"Gusion; Claude; Kimmy\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"64\",\"heroName\":\"Aldous\",\"heroSlug\":\"aldous\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_433f9653743e72e1e152428d26838f9e.png\",\"tip\":\"Eudora; Aldous; Karrie\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Baxia Mark\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Baxia activates the \\\"Baxia Mark\\\" permanently, reducing the final damage received by 15 (+1*Hero Level).\\nAt the same time, Baxia will reduce the Shield and HP Regen of enemies hit by his skills by 40% for 4s.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Baxia activates the \\\"Baxia Mark\\\" permanently, reducing the final damage received by 15 (+1*Hero Level).\\nAt the same time, Baxia will reduce the Shield and HP Regen of enemies hit by his skills by 40% for 4s.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_3d613bfe966ceef6b69452592a41820e.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Debuff\"]},{\"name\":\"Baxia-Shield Unity\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Baxia retracts himself into his shield and accelerates forward. When hitting an enemy unit, he will deal 300 (+60% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to it and nearby enemies, stunning the target for 0.8s and slightly knocking nearby enemies back.\\nDuring the process of accelerating forward, use this skill again to launch Baxia upward so that he can cross obstacles and enemy minions. When leaping up, if there is an enemy hero under Baxia, he will strike this hero, dealing 375 (+75% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to this hero and nearby enemies, stunning the target hit for 1.5s, and slightly knocking other nearby enemy targets back.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Baxia retracts himself into his shield and accelerates forward. When hitting an enemy unit, he will deal 300\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+60% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to it and nearby enemies, stunning the target for 0.8s and slightly knocking nearby enemies back.\\nDuring the process of accelerating forward, use this skill again to launch Baxia upward so that he can cross obstacles and enemy minions. When leaping up, if there is an enemy hero under Baxia, he will strike this hero, dealing 375\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+75% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to this hero and nearby enemies, stunning the target hit for 1.5s, and slightly knocking other nearby enemy targets back.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"18s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d88e98786a2d23d7d3f350a154a6d12.png\",\"tags\":[\"Speed Up\",\"CC\"]},{\"name\":\"Shield of Spirit\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Baxia throws out his shield, dealing 120 (+100% Total Magic Power) (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage to enemies along the way, marking them for 5s, and slowing them by 50% for 1s. The shield disappears upon hitting the first enemy hero or creep.\\nBaxia can cast the skill again in a short while. If an enemy hero or creep is hit by the skill, the skill's cooldown will be reduced to 15%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Baxia throws out his shield, dealing 120\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 5% target's Max HP) Magic Damage to enemies along the way, marking them for 5s, and slowing them by 50% for 1s. The shield disappears upon hitting the first enemy hero or creep.\\nBaxia can cast the skill again in a short while. If an enemy hero or creep is hit by the skill, the skill's cooldown will be reduced to 15%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"7s\",\"manaCost\":\"20\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_66f13bc7bac649d5a92736041aede552.png\",\"tags\":[\"Damage\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Tortoise’s Puissance\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Baxia holds his shield to the front and begins sprinting frantically, gaining 30% extra Movement Speed for 10s while leaving a lava path behind. Enemies on the path will take 40 (+30% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage and be slowed by 15% for 0.5s every 0.5s.\\nFor the duration, the Damage Reduction effect from Baxia Mark is increased to 200%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Baxia holds his shield to the front and begins sprinting frantically, gaining 30% extra Movement Speed for 10s while leaving a lava path behind. Enemies on the path will take 40\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+30% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage and be slowed by 15% for 0.5s every 0.5s.\\nFor the duration, the Damage Reduction effect from \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Baxia Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is increased to 200%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"40s\",\"manaCost\":\"150\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ebc90115517fd270e7c825e7724be631.png\",\"tags\":[\"Speed Up\",\"AOE\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"It’s wise to upgrade 2nd Skill first and then, the Ultimate Skill if possible. Upgrade 1st Skill at last.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"It’s wise to upgrade 2nd Skill first and then, the Ultimate Skill if possible. Upgrade 1st Skill at last.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"thamuz\",\"heroName\":\"Thamuz\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Baxia can utilize his AOE damage and slow effect to help sustained damage heroes like Thamuz and Alpha stay on their targets.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"alpha\",\"heroName\":\"Alpha\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Baxia can utilize his AOE damage and slow effect to help sustained damage heroes like Thamuz and Alpha stay on their targets.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, first activate Baxia's 1st Skill, then use his Ultimate to speed up. After running into an enemy, use his 2nd Skill followed by Basic Attacks to deal damage.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d88e98786a2d23d7d3f350a154a6d12.png\"},{\"skillId\":8730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ebc90115517fd270e7c825e7724be631.png\"},{\"skillId\":8720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_66f13bc7bac649d5a92736041aede552.png\"},{\"skillId\":8700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, roll into the enemy with Baxia's 1st Skill and follow up with his 2nd Skill and Basic Attacks.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":8710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6d88e98786a2d23d7d3f350a154a6d12.png\"},{\"skillId\":8720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_66f13bc7bac649d5a92736041aede552.png\"},{\"skillId\":8700,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Baxia build, counter, and strategy guide for MLBB roam or jungle. Use anti-heal timing, emblem choices, item flexes, and draft traps in Mobile Legends.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Baxia is the tank you pick when the enemy draft plans to win by healing through your damage. He is not a blind engage roamer. He is a moving anti-sustain zone that needs terrain, follow-up damage, and a clear target list before the lobby starts.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"baxia\",\"patch\":\"2.1.95\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-18\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-anti-sustain-default\",\"name\":\"Roam Anti-Sustain Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\",\"cost\":2150,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\",\"cost\":2170,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"guardian-helmet\",\"name\":\"Guardian Helmet\",\"cost\":2500,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"},{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"tank\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"vitality\",\"name\":\"Vitality\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/vitality.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"concussive-blast\",\"name\":\"Concussive Blast\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/concussive-blast.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"flicker\",\"name\":\"Flicker\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against repeated magic ticks or burn patterns instead of one burst mage opening.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when a basic-attack marksman is forced to keep hitting you during objective fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"warrior-boots\",\"name\":\"Warrior Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use only when the enemy damage is heavily physical and control duration is not stopping your roll.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default roam setup for drafts where Baxia must apply anti-sustain, survive first contact, and keep objective fights grouped.\",\"totalCost\":11650,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":4420,\"sources\":[\"Athena's Shield\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\",\"Guardian Helmet\"]},{\"key\":\"hpregen\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hpRegen\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":26,\"sources\":[\"Athena's Shield\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Guardian Helmet\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":95,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\",\"Antique Cuirass\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":106,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Athena's Shield\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":40,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=baxia\u0026items=tough-boots%2Cdominance-ice%2Cathenas-shield%2Cantique-cuirass%2Cimmortality%2Cguardian-helmet\u0026blessing=encourage\u0026spell=flicker\u0026emblem=tank\u0026talents=vitality%2Ctenacity%2Cconcussive-blast\u0026flex=radiant-armor.athenas-shield%2Cblade-armor.antique-cuirass%2Cwarrior-boots.tough-boots\"},{\"slot\":2,\"id\":\"jungle-tempo-anti-heal\",\"name\":\"Jungle Tempo Anti-Heal\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\