ans of the Cadia Riverlands, Baxia is tasked with protecting the Eastern lands from supernatural threats. His spinning shell attack allows him to roll across the battlefield at tremendous speed, reducing the healing of any enemy he strikes. When the Dragon Lord Yu Zhong broke free from his seal, Baxia was the first guardian to mobilize. His ancient duty now drives him across the Land of Dawn, seeking allies for the coming war.\",\"allies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"akai\",\"heroName\":\"Akai\",\"relationship\":\"Eastern guardian and sparring partner\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"relationship\":\"Tang Sect warrior and fellow Eastern defender\"}],\"rivals\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"yu-zhong\",\"heroName\":\"Yu Zhong\",\"relationship\":\"Dragon Lord he was created to seal away\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"franco\",\"heroName\":\"Franco\",\"relationship\":\"Northern warrior whose hook bounces off his shell\"}]},\"loreUrlName\":\"Baxia\",\"statsHistory\":[{\"date\":\"2026-09-07\",\"winRate\":46.91,\"pickRate\":0.07,\"banRate\":0.16},{\"date\":\"2026-09-10\",\"winRate\":47.11,\"pickRate\":0.07,\"banRate\":0.16},{\"date\":\"2026-09-16\",\"winRate\":47.02,\"pickRate\":0.06,\"banRate\":0.13},{\"date\":\"2026-09-28\",\"winRate\":47.33,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.09},{\"date\":\"2026-10-02\",\"winRate\":47.12,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.09},{\"date\":\"2026-10-09\",\"winRate\":47.04,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.09},{\"date\":\"2026-10-17\",\"winRate\":47.01,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.1}]},\"relatedHeroesSlot\":\"$L66\",\"statsSeoSlot\":\"$L67\",\"fieldManualSlot\":\"$L68\"}]\n61:[\"$\",\"$L69\",null,{\"heroName\":\"Baxia\",\"heroSlug\":\"baxia\",\"roles\":\"$60:props:hero:role\",\"lanes\":\"$60:props:hero:lane\",\"difficulty\":1,\"winRate\":47.01,\"pickRate\":0.05,\"banRate\":0.1,\"curatedBuilds\":\"$60:props:curatedBuilds\",\"topCounters\":\"$60:props:tabData:counterData:countersThisHero\",\"hasCounterPage\":true,\"hasRankStats\":true,\"locale\":\"en\",\"pageUrl\